1px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia-Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Meia Maratona do Funchal (21,097 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 34,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 39,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 44,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Curta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Maratona do Funchal (8,3 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 17,50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 20,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/12 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona do Funchal 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 12\u00aa Maratona do Funchal realiza-se no domingo, 31 de janeiro de 2027, na cidade do Funchal (Ilha da Madeira). A Maratona (42,195 km) parte \u00e0s 07:00, a Mini Maratona (8,3 km) \u00e0s 08:30 e a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (at\u00e9 31 de outubro, de 1 a 30 de novembro e de 1 a 31 de dezembro de 2026): a Maratona custa 70 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 90 \u20ac; a Meia Maratona custa 34 \u20ac, 39 \u20ac e 44 \u20ac; e a Mini Maratona (8,3 km) tem o valor de 17,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 30 de novembro e 20,00 \u20ac em dezembro.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais os tempos limite e servi\u00e7os inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os tempos limite oficiais s\u00e3o de 6 horas na Maratona, 3 horas na Meia Maratona e 1h30 na Mini Maratona. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro desportivo, dorsal com chip MyLaps BibTag, t-shirt oficial (vers\u00e3o Premium e voucher para a Pasta Party nos 42 km), transporte gratuito para as partidas nos autocarros dos Hor\u00e1rios do Funchal, servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa (Bag Drop), marcadores de ritmo (3h00, 3h30, 4h00 e 4h30 na Maratona) e medalha de finalista.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios na Maratona do Funchal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a dist\u00e2ncia de Maratona (42,195 km) atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina (600 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba lugar, 375 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba lugar e 250 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba lugar), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio nas tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e onde me posso inscrever?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira (AARAM). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es podem ser efetuadas online em madeiramarathon.com ou presencialmente na sede da AARAM (Est\u00e1dio de C\u00e2mara de Lobos).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona do Funchal 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Funchal, Ilha da Madeira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Funchal\", \"addressRegion\": \"Madeira\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona do Funchal 2027 realiza-se a 31 de janeiro na Ilha da Madeira. Provas de 42 km, Meia Maratona 21 km e Mini Maratona 8,3 km. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-maratona-do-funchal.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Maratona do Funchal (42,195 km)\", \"price\": \"75.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.madeiramarathon.com\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona do Funchal (21,097 km)\", \"price\": \"39.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.madeiramarathon.com\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Maratona do Funchal (8,3 km)\", \"price\": \"17.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.madeiramarathon.com\/\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo da Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma da Madeira (AARAM)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona do Funchal 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 12\u00aa Maratona do Funchal realiza-se no domingo, 31 de janeiro de 2027, na cidade do Funchal (Ilha da Madeira). A Maratona (42,195 km) parte \u00e0s 07:00, a Mini Maratona (8,3 km) \u00e0s 08:30 e a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) \u00e0s 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (at\u00e9 31 de outubro, de 1 a 30 de novembro e de 1 a 31 de dezembro de 2026): a Maratona custa 70 \u20ac, 75 \u20ac e 90 \u20ac; a Meia Maratona custa 34 \u20ac, 39 \u20ac e 44 \u20ac; e a Mini Maratona (8,3 km) tem o valor de 17,50 \u20ac at\u00e9 30 de novembro e 20,00 \u20ac em dezembro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"